repository-code: https://github.com/BrightbeamAI/chap
url: https://github.com/BrightbeamAI/chap
abstract: >-
  An open protocol for recording human decisions over AI agent work.
  Approvals, edits, overrides and escalations become signed, hash-chained,
  queryable records rather than fragments spread across application logs,
  chat threads and ticket comments. Core is seven methods and one envelope
  over JSON-RPC 2.0, with eleven optional profiles, two reference
  implementations, and MCP and A2A transports.
